:[{"id":"mingdi-e-o046a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3ff5cbdc8f2c5963da4d","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，己酉〖15〗，中山王衮薨〖16〗。壬申〖17〗，太白昼现。十一月，丁酉〖18〗，行幸许昌宫。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":295,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e98ed256e58910694910","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e98ed256e58910694910","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：青龙三年（公元 235）。明帝将司马懿提升为太尉，使他让出大将军一职，出自深层次政治考量。太尉作为三公之首，品级地位虽然略高于大将军，但是在控制军事实权和亲近皇帝的程度上，却比不上后者。明帝是要为曹氏亲族的年轻将领腾出这一重要位置，与异姓元勋重臣进行力量平衡，从而保证皇权安定稳固。戊子：旧历初八日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":297,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ddf87e6819a0a2dfe019","start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o043","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-9b32a12fd737552ea52d","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，戊子〖1〗，以大将军司马宣王为太尉。己亥〖2〗。复置朔方郡。京都大疫。丁巳〖3〗，皇太后崩。乙亥〖4〗，陨石于寿光县〖5〗。三月，庚寅〖6〗，葬文德郭后。营陵于首阳陵涧西〖7〗，如终制。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o046","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3ff5cbdc8f2c5963da4d","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，己酉〖15〗，中山王衮薨〖16〗。壬申〖17〗，太白昼现。十一月，丁酉〖18〗，行幸许昌宫。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":295,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-00f1c6bfb8f7681baddd","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"太和二年，就国。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-02781471d2fed2a48275","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-67fcad00ce83bb4ef583","layer":"original","quote":"其年，又改封赞侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":79,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-0f3dbbf189fe70434b4a","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-9c32ad41461db0f2cc57","layer":"original","quote":"其年，黄龙现邺西漳水，衮上书赞颂。诏赐黄金千斤，诏曰：“昔唐叔馈禾〖9〗，东平献颂〖10〗；斯皆骨肉赞美，以彰懿亲。王研精坟典，耽味道真〖11〗，文雅焕炳；朕甚嘉之！王其克慎明德，以终令闻。”","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-15f42cc9fe03b8c95e0e","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-9c32ad41461db0f2cc57","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖13〗，徙封濮阳。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":119,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-18449d2acb2a0b420f95","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ececd53104f5341a2ca0","layer":"original","quote":"凡所著文章二万余言。才不及陈思王，而好与之侔〖34〗。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-271103c4f335abdc509a","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"尚约俭，教敕妃妾纺绩织[，习为家人之事。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":8,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-2c90e70fa06139a657a6","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖19〗，复所削县。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":143,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-32ed4c641fbcfc4c47d2","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-67fcad00ce83bb4ef583","layer":"original","quote":"中山恭王衮，建安二十一年，封平乡侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-3de1bea44c3d5fa70bfc","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"三年秋，衮得疾病，诏遣太医视疾；殿中虎贲赍手诏、赐珍膳相属〖20〗；又遣太妃、沛王林并就省疾〖21〗。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":155,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-4150d0d63cee5cb84f53","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"﹝一﹞衮忧惧，戒敕官属愈谨；帝嘉其意。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":124,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-667e849f659c9e99d8d3","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"五年冬〖14〗，入朝。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-745484a5c7bd9e937108","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-9c32ad41461db0f2cc57","layer":"original","quote":"三年〖8〗，为北海王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-7c9bde4a32fd48ac0e0b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c8ed5abc00ee3125e216","layer":"original","quote":"衮疾困，敕令官属曰：“吾寡德忝宠，大命将尽。吾既好俭，而圣朝著终诰之制〖22〗，为天下法。吾气绝之日，自殡及葬，务奉诏书。昔卫大夫蘧瑗葬濮阳〖23〗，吾望其墓，常想其遗风，愿托贤灵以弊发齿〖24〗；营吾兆城，必往从之。《礼》：‘男子不卒妇人之手〖25〗。’亟以时成东堂〖26〗。”堂成，名之曰“遂志之堂”，舆疾往居之〖27〗。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-8912427353ea55290900","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖15〗，改封中山。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-a1be9bd5faa5383881d7","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-27a9ece946e7d4ac8dac","layer":"original","quote":"其年薨。诏沛王林留，讫葬；使大鸿胪持节典护丧事，宗正吊祭，赠赗甚厚。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":236,"end":270,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-b27744249584a4e52cb7","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-9c32ad41461db0f2cc57","layer":"original","quote":"”四年〖12〗，改封赞王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":106,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-b49a1eaabeb775fd1ab3","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-27a9ece946e7d4ac8dac","layer":"original","quote":"又令世子曰：“汝幼少，未闻义方〖28〗，早为人君；但知乐，不知苦；不知苦，必将以骄奢为失也。接大臣，务以礼；虽非大臣，老者犹宜答拜。事兄以敬〖29〗，恤弟以慈；兄弟有不良之行，当造膝谏之〖30〗；谏之不从，流涕喻之；喻之不改，乃白其母；若犹不改，当以奏闻，并辞国土：与其守宠罹祸，不若贫贱全身也。此亦谓大罪恶耳。其微过细故，当掩覆之〖31〗。嗟尔小子，慎修乃身；奉圣朝以忠贞，事太妃以孝敬。闺闱之内〖32〗，奉令于太妃；阃阈之外〖33〗，受教于沛王。无怠乃心，以慰予灵。”","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":236,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c47afe06cafde1b20be5","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-304a2f10b8699a984a22","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》载玺书曰：“制诏中山王：有司奏，王乃者来朝，犯交通京师之禁；朕惟亲亲之恩，用寝吏议。然法者，所与天下共也，不可得废。今削王县二，户七百五十。夫克己复礼，圣人称仁；朝过夕改，君子与之。王其戒诸，无贰咎悔也。”","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3a240b195a904599c612","start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-cb2d2946ccc0d2a4ad04","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c0193aec797ff97f33c3","layer":"original","quote":"每兄弟游娱，衮独覃思经典〖4〗。文学、防辅相与言曰〖5〗：“受诏察公举措，有过当奏；及有善，亦宜以闻，不可匿其美也。”遂共表，称陈衮美。衮闻之，大惊惧；责让文学曰〖6〗：“修身自守，常人之行耳；而诸君乃以上闻，是适所以增其负累也。且如有善，何患不闻；而遽共如是，是非益我者〖7〗！”其戒慎如此。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-d785aa14c0445890e7ee","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-67fcad00ce83bb4ef583","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年〖2〗，徙封东乡侯；","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":65,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-e91eaebaad8e6172818f","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0cc2b4cf9dd0f8d6f1f3","layer":"original","quote":"初，衮来朝，犯京都禁〖16〗。青龙元年，有司奏衮。诏曰：“王素敬慎，邂逅至此〖17〗。其以议亲之典议之〖18〗。”有司固执。诏削县二，户七百五十。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-eef9017b853bea62ee22","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c8da50a11820efa792dd","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，进爵为公，官属皆贺，衮曰：“夫生深宫之中，不知稼穑之艰难，多骄逸之失。诸贤既庆其休〖3〗，宜辅其阙。”","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-f0f6696d153d3d0a89f6","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-67fcad00ce83bb4ef583","layer":"original","quote":"少好学，年十余岁，能属文。每读书，文学左右常恐以精力为病〖1〗，数谏止之；然性所乐，不能废也。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
